## Configuration (`.env`)

Create a `.env` file in the root directory:

```env
# PostgreSQL Configuration
DB_NAME=[DB_Name]
DB_USER=[DB_User]
DB_PASS=[DB_Password]
DB_HOST=[DB_Host]
DB_PORT=[DB_Port]

# Local Ollama AI Engine Settings
OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
EMBEDDING_MODEL=[Embedding_Model]
LARGE_LANGUAGE_MODEL=[LLM]
```

